{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [36.8503, 62.632058400000005, 107.49640480000002, 70.13457920000008], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "caption", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": "Table 2 (continued)"}, {"bbox": [36.851078, 497.0407671, 548.2610867999999, 511.13878463333333], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "ASP, asparaginase; bid, twice daily; CADVT, catheter-associated DVT; CrCl, creatinine clearance; INR, international normalized ratio; NA, not applicable; NR, not reported; peg-ASP, pegylated asparaginase; po, by mouth; qd, once daily; SD, standard deviation; SC, subcutaneous."}, {"bbox": [43.313824, 512.9716450999999, 115.52565539999999, 519.0760716333333], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "*Also included in PICO 9."}, {"bbox": [43.313824, 520.9652361, 134.40426440000002, 527.0696626333333], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "†Also included in PICO 5 and 8."}, {"bbox": [43.313824, 528.9018510999999, 253.5474401, 535.0062776333333], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "‡Anti-factor Xa levels obtained but dose was not adjusted based on levels."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 568.1869056, 287.93976180000004, 653.3430834666667], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 5, "source": "docling", "text": "for VTE prophylaxis in pediatric patients. The panel identified the urgent need to investigate the safety and efficacy of different anticoagulant agents, and to determine their optimal dosing, timing, and duration for VTE prevention across different pediatric subgroups. The panel also recognized the need for guidance and standardization in the reporting of anticoagulant regimens within pediatric studies to ensure that comprehensive and uniform information is provided."}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 671.1946934, 215.5419909, 682.4484275333333], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 6, "source": "docling", "text": "Limitations of these guidelines"}, {"bbox": [36.8503, 688.7161946, 287.9326042, 708.1097844666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 7, "source": "docling", "text": "The recommendations in these guidelines were limited in every case by very low or low certainty in the evidence. For certain recommendations, there was scarce or no published direct or relevant indirect evidence, and the panel was anonymously surveyed to provide unpublished collective data to use for decisionmaking. This process was performed in agreement with all panel members and is explicitly identified for relevant recommendations."}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 635.3077084, 511.4283234, 660.5070675333334], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 8, "source": "docling", "text": "Summary of conclusions and future research recommendations"}, {"bbox": [305.857971, 666.7758946, 556.9357712000001, 708.1088764666666], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 27, "seq": 9, "source": "docling", "text": "There is a lack of high-quality evidence to guide the use of anticoagulant prophylaxis for VTE prevention across diverse pediatric subgroups. Overall, the heterogeneity of pediatric patients in terms of VTE and bleeding risk profiles, even within specific subgroups,"}], "checksum": "f7386d973bcf0c4fdee02676930fe21eff0806f98a2e8c528d2daca5523637a8", "content_present": true, "doc_id": "d-97b717427b6bf503", "docling_version": "2.118.0", "engine_version": "2.118.0", "errors": [], "images": [], "page_index": 26, "page_sizes": {"27": [593.9719848632812, 782.9860229492188]}, "route": "docling", "schema_version": "v0.1.0", "source_hash": "97b717427b6bf503d2817d27c02c788bde996058c4ef8ebaee3678ae31782ea1", "status": "ok", "tables": [{"bbox": [35.77777342131065, 70.24052928133642, 558.2746329112825, 492.9569290062225], "body_bottom": 489.0275272130966, "caption": "Table 2 (continued)", "cell_bboxes": [[[45.77101989090443, 100.22389943152666, 115.89415633678436, 108.62929942458868], [161.38817927241325, 99.78249010443687, 177.51781672239304, 108.60248249769211], [212.98621308803558, 100.6485233604908, 255.78371930122375, 109.10574188828468], [330.9981998205185, 100.03744158148766, 343.76331102848053, 108.7342444062233], [352.2265591621399, 100.58409529179335, 358.7139365673065, 109.26816567033529], [446.25345718860626, 100.6489456743002, 488.4508126974106, 109.05949537456036]], [[45.603982508182526, 113.53849890828133, 114.43167597055435, 122.00788889825344], [147.72536998987198, 113.67456904798746, 194.9780049920082, 122.55478212982416], [220.6842838525772, 113.73458173125982, 232.3939586877823, 122.58423063904047], [331.703825712204, 112.33443811535835, 343.22084498405457, 121.03361724317074], [353.6385576725006, 113.0944201797247, 361.8918821811676, 121.8423670977354], [445.6054537296295, 114.12860681861639, 459.21492648124695, 122.63235550373793]], [[46.10210969299078, 126.81032808125019, 110.28528767824173, 135.23112677037716], [165.0829610824585, 126.07650426030159, 177.93659055233002, 134.68033501505852], [222.71198987960815, 126.46747860312462, 234.08349072933197, 135.04692861437798], [332.14990174770355, 126.91372562944889, 342.92797243595123, 135.4850067049265], [353.37595868110657, 127.18952175974846, 362.37831258773804, 135.8924638926983], [446.78951382637024, 127.01070022583008, 457.14344358444214,